<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Tennis-Australia win second Davis Cup singles MATCH.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Tennis-Australia win second Davis Cup singles MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singles results from the first round Davis Cup world group tie between France and Australia at Sydney's White City on Friday:</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 3-6 6-7 (5-7) 6-4 7-5 6-4.</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Arnaud Boetsch (France) 6-4 6-4 6-3. Australia lead 2-0.</p>
